{"type":"text","timestamp":1794355532716,"sessionID":"ses_e38170798fferFf1mK07jkjW4e","part":{"id":"prt_1c7ec939f001ANUv8d45lFwf19","messageID":"msg_1c7ec8249001iFV0Pt7cuaPww1","sessionID":"ses_e38170798fferFf1mK07jkjW4e","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the shared UI components (badges, layout) and pages.\n\nLet me create `src/components.tsx` with:\n- SeverityBadge\n- StatusBadge\n- Card / Panel\n- ErrorBanner (shows error + field errors)\n- formatDateTime helper\n\nAnd `src/format.ts` for date formatting.\n\nLet me write a helpers file `src/ui.tsx`:\n\n```tsx\nexport function formatDateTime(value: string | null): string\nexport function formatRelativeDue(dueAt: string): string\n```\n\nFor date formatting, use `new Date(value).toLocaleString()`.\n\nLet me write components.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794355532703,"end":1794355532713}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794355532738,"sessionID":"ses_e38170798fferFf1mK07jkjW4e","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a1c7ec8d4872f38cbaf180","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"export function formatDateTime(value: string | null): string {\n  if (!value) return \"—\";\n  const date = new Date(value);\n  if (Number.isNaN(date.getTime())) return value;\n  return date.toLocaleString(undefined, {\n    year: \"numeric\",\n    month: \"short\",\n    day: \"2-digit\",\n    hour: \"2-digit\",\n    minute: \"2-digit\",\n  });\n}\n\nexport function formatDuration(minutes: number): string {\n  if (minutes < 60) return `${minutes}m`;\n  if (minutes < 1440) return `${Math.round(minutes / 60)}h`;\n  return `${Math.round(minutes / 1440)}d`;\n}\n\nexport function targetMinutes(severity: string): number {\n  switch (severity) {\n    case \"sev1\":\n      return 60;\n    case \"sev2\":\n      return 240;\n    case \"sev3\":\n      return 1440;\n    default:\n      return 4320;\n  }\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/format.ts"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/format.ts","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/format.ts","time":{"start":1794355532710,"end":1794355532719}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c7ec93a2001MnsDQGD8xJzxbD","sessionID":"ses_e38170798fferFf1mK07jkjW4e","messageID":"msg_1c7ec8249001iFV0Pt7cuaPww1"}}
