{"type":"text","timestamp":1794355610472,"sessionID":"ses_e38170798fferFf1mK07jkjW4e","part":{"id":"prt_1c7edc350001ZnqhBUy8qG9FyY","messageID":"msg_1c7edb93f001fVM50c10P9g7yV","sessionID":"ses_e38170798fferFf1mK07jkjW4e","type":"text","text":"<think>TypeScript 7.0.2 is out (the native port). Hmm, TypeScript 7 might be a big change; let's use it if it works, otherwise 5.x. Let me check what 5.x latest is: `npm view typescript@5 version`.\n\nLet me be careful: TS 7 (tsgo) should be compatible with TS 5.9 semantics. But `tsc --noEmit` with TS7 native binary might behave the same. To minimize risk, I'll install typescript@5.9.x if available.\n\nLet me check.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794355610448,"end":1794355610468}}}
